Output demo/output/prompt-demo.mp4
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1280
Set Height 400
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Padding 20

Type "cat songs/traditional/when-the-saints-go-marching-in.prompt"
Enter 1
Sleep 4s

Type "echo '→ Claude builds the song and generates the REAPER project'"
Enter 1
Sleep 3s
